What's wrong now?

561
00:21:56,120 --> 00:21:59,400
Dad, tell me, why is he so cold-blooded?

562
00:21:59,400 --> 00:22:01,160
He doesn't take after Uncle Li at all.

563
00:22:01,160 --> 00:22:01,960
Why wouldn't he?

564
00:22:01,960 --> 00:22:02,560
It's in his blood.

565
00:22:02,560 --> 00:22:03,400
What do you mean?

566
00:22:03,400 --> 00:22:04,960
Your Uncle Li is even more cold-blooded.

567
00:22:04,960 --> 00:22:06,160
Uncle Li is cold-blooded?

568
00:22:06,160 --> 00:22:07,200
When he arrested us back then,

569
00:22:07,200 --> 00:22:09,320
hands behind our backs, handcuffs on,

570
00:22:09,320 --> 00:22:10,120
he was completely impartial.

571
00:22:10,120 --> 00:22:12,200
But Xin is really a good kid.

572
00:22:12,320 --> 00:22:13,400
Why can't you stand him?

573
00:22:13,400 --> 00:22:15,440
My opinion of him is very objective.

574
00:22:15,480 --> 00:22:16,800
He's just cold-blooded.

575
00:22:16,800 --> 00:22:17,640
Are you angry?

576
00:22:19,320 --> 00:22:20,400
The best way to get back at him

577
00:22:20,400 --> 00:22:22,320
is to eat the sea cucumber he bought.

578
00:22:22,320 --> 00:22:23,320
What kind of idea is that?

579
00:22:23,320 --> 00:22:24,400
Really, you stewed it.

580
00:22:24,400 --> 00:22:27,130
Look, didn't Li Xin buy this little sea cucumber?

581
00:22:29,400 --> 00:22:31,260
It tastes like Li Xin when stewed.

582
00:22:31,320 --> 00:22:33,240
Eat it. Punish him.

583
00:22:34,080 --> 00:22:36,360
Some people have a sharp tongue but a soft heart.

584
00:22:36,360 --> 00:22:36,920
What they think in their hearts

585
00:22:36,920 --> 00:22:39,160
is completely different from what they say.

586
00:22:39,160 --> 00:22:40,200
Eat up.

587
00:22:40,200 --> 00:22:41,120
Okay.

588
00:22:42,560 --> 00:22:43,320
Coming.

589
00:22:45,640 --> 00:22:46,770
Don't you have a key?

590
00:22:52,680 --> 00:22:55,360
Look at you, always buying things from such expensive places.

591
00:22:55,360 --> 00:22:56,000
It's fine.

592
00:23:04,240 --> 00:23:05,100
Let me help you.

593
00:23:05,320 --> 00:23:06,120
No need.

594
00:23:06,120 --> 00:23:06,560
Come on.

595
00:23:06,560 --> 00:23:07,320
No need.

596
00:23:20,640 --> 00:23:21,640
Just answer it.

597
00:23:22,760 --> 00:23:23,800
It's no big deal.

598
00:23:24,720 --> 00:23:26,200
I just won't listen.

599
00:23:30,040 --> 00:23:30,400
Mom.

600
00:23:30,400 --> 00:23:32,320
Son, look.

601
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:34,800
Jeffrey, he's your brother.

602
00:23:34,800 --> 00:23:35,400
Say hi.

603
00:23:35,400 --> 00:23:36,400
Hello.

604
00:23:39,400 --> 00:23:40,920
Wilson. Wilson is here.

605
00:23:41,200 --> 00:23:41,880
Li Xin.

606
00:23:41,880 --> 00:23:43,280
You look great.

607
00:23:43,400 --> 00:23:45,120
We were just talking about you.

608
00:23:45,120 --> 00:23:47,400
When are you coming to Canada?

609
00:23:47,480 --> 00:23:48,410
Thanks, Wilson.

610
00:23:49,600 --> 00:23:51,360
I'll definitely go when I have time.

611
00:23:51,360 --> 00:23:52,640
I'm going to get some water.

612
00:23:52,640 --> 00:23:53,700
See you later, Xin.

613
00:23:54,600 --> 00:23:55,400
Son.

614
00:23:56,040 --> 00:23:57,440
How have you been lately?

615
00:23:57,680 --> 00:23:58,410
Pretty good.

616
00:23:58,640 --> 00:23:59,400
I heard

617
00:23:59,720 --> 00:24:01,600
you got promoted to senior partner.

618
00:24:01,600 --> 00:24:02,920
Such good news.

619
00:24:02,920 --> 00:24:04,320
Why didn't you tell Mom?

620
00:24:04,600 --> 00:24:05,240
I saw it

621
00:24:05,240 --> 00:24:07,520
on your Honghu official account.

622
00:24:07,840 --> 00:24:08,960
I was too busy and forgot.

623
00:24:08,960 --> 00:24:10,840
Mom sent you a promotion gift.

624
00:24:10,840 --> 00:24:11,920
Did you get it?

625
00:24:12,160 --> 00:24:12,840
I got it.

626
00:24:12,840 --> 00:24:14,600
I haven't had time to open it yet.

627
00:24:14,600 --> 00:24:15,960
I'll open it when I get back today.

628
00:24:15,960 --> 00:24:17,620
Are you at Li Guochen's place?

629
00:24:17,960 --> 00:24:18,640
Yes.

630
00:24:19,120 --> 00:24:20,680
You go there quite often.

631
00:24:21,160 --> 00:24:23,080
He's enjoying life now.

632
00:24:23,960 --> 00:24:25,800
My dad is retired now.

633
00:24:25,800 --> 00:24:26,640
He's alone.

634
00:24:26,840 --> 00:24:27,600
Besides,

635
00:24:28,200 --> 00:24:29,640
isn't it my duty as a son?

636
00:24:31,160 --> 00:24:33,400
Mom, let's talk later.

637
00:24:33,400 --> 00:24:34,920
Take good care of yourself.

638
00:24:34,920 --> 00:24:35,720
You hear me?

639
00:24:35,840 --> 00:24:37,080
Don't work too hard.

640
00:24:37,160 --> 00:24:38,360
Bye.

641
00:24:46,160 --> 00:24:46,600
Done.

642
00:24:46,960 --> 00:24:47,800
Let me help you.

643
00:24:47,800 --> 00:24:48,160
No, thanks.

644
00:24:48,160 --> 00:24:49,400
I can do it.

645
00:24:52,480 --> 00:24:53,160
Then...

646
00:25:19,800 --> 00:25:21,400
Your Honor, please note

647
00:25:21,400 --> 00:25:23,080
the chronological order between

648
00:25:23,080 --> 00:25:25,720
the death of the insured

649
00:25:25,720 --> 00:25:26,600
and the removal of the ventilator.

650
00:25:26,600 --> 00:25:29,000
The medical and discharge records state that

651
00:25:29,000 --> 00:25:30,640
the child was in critical condition,

652
00:25:30,640 --> 00:25:33,840
and the family was informed.

653
00:25:34,200 --> 00:25:35,600
The family understood

654
00:25:35,600 --> 00:25:37,640
and voluntarily gave up treatment.

655
00:25:37,840 --> 00:25:39,440
Requested to be discharged.

656
00:25:52,800 --> 00:25:55,840
I heard about the pre-trial meeting last time.

657
00:25:56,920 --> 00:25:58,680
Thanks for your help with this lawsuit.

658
00:25:58,680 --> 00:25:59,840
You're too kind, Mr. Chen.

659
00:25:59,840 --> 00:26:00,920
It's my job.

660
00:26:01,000 --> 00:26:02,530
When is the official trial?

661
00:26:02,560 --> 00:26:04,560
It depends on the court's schedule.

662
00:26:08,160 --> 00:26:09,000
Attorney Li,

663
00:26:09,120 --> 00:26:12,160
is there any way to resolve this as soon as possible?

664
00:26:13,560 --> 00:26:16,640
I'm worried that if this escalates,

665
00:26:17,160 --> 00:26:19,820
it will seriously damage our brand reputation.

666
00:26:20,240 --> 00:26:21,560
What Mr. Chen means is,

667
00:26:22,080 --> 00:26:24,680
it would be best to get them to drop the lawsuit.

668
00:26:24,720 --> 00:26:27,360
The company can refund all the premiums.

669
00:26:28,840 --> 00:26:30,370
Mr. Chen, here's the thing.

670
00:26:30,440 --> 00:26:32,920
The other party is claiming 400,000 yuan,

671
00:26:33,680 --> 00:26:34,920
but the total premiums for four years

672
00:26:34,920 --> 00:26:36,450
are only about 40,000 yuan.

673
00:26:36,920 --> 00:26:39,380
I'm afraid it will be hard for them to accept.

674
00:26:39,400 --> 00:26:41,730
It's not that we don't want to compensate,

675
00:26:41,920 --> 00:26:43,320
it's just that their situation

676
00:26:43,320 --> 00:26:45,400
really doesn't meet the claim conditions.

677
00:26:45,400 --> 00:26:47,320
We can't set this precedent.

678
00:26:50,960 --> 00:26:53,490
How about this? We refund double the premium.

679
00:26:54,200 --> 00:26:55,360
This is the most sincere offer

680
00:26:55,360 --> 00:26:56,560
we can make.

681
00:27:02,800 --> 00:27:03,930
Lawyer Xiao is here.

682
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:06,480
Sorry, it's a bit messy here.

683
00:27:06,480 --> 00:27:07,940
Let's go upstairs to talk.

684
00:27:15,200 --> 00:27:16,730
Please have a seat, you two.

685
00:27:22,600 --> 00:27:24,640
Those photos are really well taken.

686
00:27:25,360 --> 00:27:27,480
Other kids get fussy when taking photos,

687
00:27:27,480 --> 00:27:28,880
but Xinxin is different.

688
00:27:29,120 --> 00:27:31,050
Whenever the camera points at her,

689
00:27:31,600 --> 00:27:32,360
she smiles.

690
00:27:44,280 --> 00:27:45,120
Lawyer Xiao,

691
00:27:45,880 --> 00:27:48,340
can we win when the trial officially starts?

692
00:27:49,280 --> 00:27:51,880
The exact date of the trial is still uncertain.

693
00:27:52,680 --> 00:27:53,480
We can't rule out

694
00:27:53,480 --> 00:27:56,000
the possibility that the other party might want to settle.

695
00:27:56,000 --> 00:27:56,960
Settle?

696
00:27:58,320 --> 00:27:59,720
Absolutely impossible.

697
00:27:59,960 --> 00:28:01,600
They've said such awful things.

698
00:28:01,600 --> 00:28:02,840
How could we possibly settle?

699
00:28:02,840 --> 00:28:04,840
I understand how you feel, Mr. Han.

700
00:28:05,240 --> 00:28:08,480
But I must remind you,

701
00:28:08,960 --> 00:28:11,000
if you choose not to settle,

702
00:28:11,160 --> 00:28:12,290
and we lose the case,

703
00:28:12,400 --> 00:28:15,800
it's very likely you won't get a single cent in compensation.

704
00:28:16,240 --> 00:28:18,500
Lawyer Xiao, I understand what you mean.

705
00:28:18,920 --> 00:28:21,520
But ever since I decided to fight this lawsuit,

706
00:28:21,640 --> 00:28:23,640
I haven't considered any other path.

707
00:28:23,640 --> 00:28:25,840
Since you've made up your mind,

708
00:28:25,840 --> 00:28:27,500
then we'll fight it to the end.

709
00:28:27,920 --> 00:28:29,120
But there's one thing

710
00:28:29,400 --> 00:28:31,260
I hope you can tell me truthfully.

711
00:28:32,240 --> 00:28:36,320
Why did you voluntarily stop the resuscitation at that time?

712
00:28:51,880 --> 00:28:52,610
Feng A-A0826

713
00:29:02,400 --> 00:29:03,640
So solemn.

714
00:29:03,920 --> 00:29:05,240
Please invite the client in.

715
00:29:05,240 --> 00:29:06,400
Um, Lawyer Luo, Lawyer Luo.

716
00:29:06,400 --> 00:29:08,880
Do you think you can handle our family's matter?

717
00:29:08,880 --> 00:29:12,640
Well, we have to see which specific regulation it falls under.

718
00:29:13,840 --> 00:29:15,800
You're so resourceful, Lawyer Luo.

719
00:29:15,800 --> 00:29:17,040
An upright official.

720
00:29:18,320 --> 00:29:19,160
You're back.

721
00:29:21,160 --> 00:29:23,620
Hello, what would you like to consult about?

722
00:29:24,120 --> 00:29:26,400
I am the chief legal advisor of our firm,

723
00:29:26,400 --> 00:29:28,530
and also a good citizen of Leyang City,

724
00:29:28,600 --> 00:29:29,400
Dong Beihu.

725
00:29:31,600 --> 00:29:32,400
Hello.

726
00:29:41,240 --> 00:29:42,240
Sword of Justice.

727
00:29:42,920 --> 00:29:43,840
I wrote that.

728
00:29:44,400 --> 00:29:47,060
I like to practice calligraphy in my spare time.

729
00:30:01,120 --> 00:30:03,580
What would you like to consult about, buddy?

730
00:30:06,320 --> 00:30:08,080
The bathroom upstairs leaked

731
00:30:08,160 --> 00:30:09,240
and flooded my apartment.

732
00:30:09,240 --> 00:30:11,360
They refused to repair it or pay compensation,

733
00:30:11,360 --> 00:30:12,840
so I turned off their water valve

734
00:30:12,840 --> 00:30:13,920
to stop them from using water.

735
00:30:13,920 --> 00:30:15,640
But they sued me.

736
00:30:16,000 --> 00:30:18,080
That's so shameless of them.

737
00:30:18,920 --> 00:30:19,760
Don't worry.

738
00:30:20,160 --> 00:30:22,040
It sounds like we're in the right.

739
00:30:22,040 --> 00:30:23,800
Just leave this case to us.

740
00:30:23,800 --> 00:30:25,960
We can definitely win, right?

741
00:30:36,120 --> 00:30:37,240
Look, it's not a big deal.

742
00:30:37,240 --> 00:30:38,880
Look, you're getting a bit worked up, right?

743
00:30:38,880 --> 00:30:39,400
Look at you.

744
00:30:39,400 --> 00:30:40,840
It's fine. Just leave it to us.

745
00:30:40,840 --> 00:30:42,840
We've got him right where we want him.

746
00:30:42,840 --> 00:30:45,720
Then what is the legal basis for getting him?

747
00:30:46,160 --> 00:30:47,400
There are so many.

748
00:30:50,640 --> 00:30:52,480
No, he's asking for the basis.

749
00:30:52,480 --> 00:30:53,360
Asking for the basis.

750
00:30:53,360 --> 00:30:54,640
Tell him the basis.

751
00:30:55,720 --> 00:30:56,650
According to...

752
00:30:56,800 --> 00:30:59,640
According to Article 288 of the Civil Code,

753
00:30:59,640 --> 00:31:01,800
neighboring right holders of real estate

754
00:31:01,800 --> 00:31:03,400
shall act in accordance with the principles of facilitating production,

755
00:31:03,400 --> 00:31:05,120
making life convenient, unity and mutual assistance,

756
00:31:05,120 --> 00:31:06,360
and fairness and reasonableness

757
00:31:06,360 --> 00:31:08,890
to correctly handle neighboring relations.

758
00:31:10,040 --> 00:31:11,040
Then according to what you said,

759
00:31:11,040 --> 00:31:12,700
I should let him use the water.

760
00:31:14,760 --> 00:31:16,120
No, this...

761
00:31:16,320 --> 00:31:19,120
Article 296 of the Civil Code

762
00:31:19,120 --> 00:31:19,880
also stipulates that

763
00:31:19,880 --> 00:31:20,880
a real estate right holder

764
00:31:20,880 --> 00:31:23,080
who, for water use, drainage, passage,

765
00:31:23,080 --> 00:31:24,320
laying pipelines, etc.,

766
00:31:24,320 --> 00:31:25,880
utilizes neighboring real estate,

767
00:31:25,880 --> 00:31:26,880
shall try to avoid

768
00:31:26,880 --> 00:31:29,440
causing damage to the neighboring real estate right holder.

769
00:31:29,440 --> 00:31:30,880
Otherwise, according to the Civil Code,

770
00:31:30,880 --> 00:31:34,120
they shall be liable for compensation under Article 179.

771
00:31:36,360 --> 00:31:37,960
Your nephew is really impressive.

772
00:31:37,960 --> 00:31:38,720
How about it, buddy?

773
00:31:38,720 --> 00:31:39,800
Did you hear the keywords?

774
00:31:39,800 --> 00:31:41,800
Compensate for losses. Compensate you.

775
00:31:41,800 --> 00:31:43,200
Look, if you are satisfied,

776
00:31:43,200 --> 00:31:44,120
let's look into it today

777
00:31:44,120 --> 00:31:45,360
and sign the agency contract.

778
00:31:45,360 --> 00:31:45,880
Right.

779
00:31:45,920 --> 00:31:46,980
I'm not satisfied.

780
00:31:47,600 --> 00:31:48,400
What's wrong?

781
00:31:48,760 --> 00:31:49,800
I turned off his water valve.

782
00:31:49,800 --> 00:31:50,640
He sued me,

783
00:31:50,640 --> 00:31:51,900
and I'm the defendant.

784
00:31:52,120 --> 00:31:53,360
If I want compensation,

785
00:31:53,360 --> 00:31:55,280
I should sue him and become the plaintiff.

786
00:31:55,280 --> 00:31:57,010
These are two different cases.

787
00:31:57,120 --> 00:31:58,480
Or I can file a counterclaim.

788
00:31:58,480 --> 00:32:00,080
But it's wrong for me to turn off his water.

789
00:32:00,080 --> 00:32:02,320
I have to turn his water valve back on first.

790
00:32:02,320 --> 00:32:02,800
Right?

791
00:32:03,320 --> 00:32:03,720
Right.

792
00:32:03,720 --> 00:32:04,280
What do you mean, right?

793
00:32:04,280 --> 00:32:05,240
Refute him!

794
00:32:05,240 --> 00:32:06,800
I can't refute him. He's right.

795
00:32:06,800 --> 00:32:07,760
He's right?

796
00:32:07,760 --> 00:32:08,720
You're right.

797
00:32:10,200 --> 00:32:10,640
Right?

798
00:32:10,640 --> 00:32:11,560
Absolutely right.

799
00:32:11,560 --> 00:32:13,480
If you're absolutely right, why are you consulting us?

800
00:32:13,480 --> 00:32:14,320
Buddy,

801
00:32:14,320 --> 00:32:15,400
what do you do?

802
00:32:15,400 --> 00:32:16,400
Are you just looking for trouble?

803
00:32:16,400 --> 00:32:18,130
Are you treating us like a joke?

804
00:32:19,800 --> 00:32:20,600
I don't smoke.

805
00:32:21,680 --> 00:32:22,640
A business card?

806
00:32:24,400 --> 00:32:25,920
Lawyer Li Xin.

807
00:32:28,480 --> 00:32:30,740
I was wondering why you looked familiar.

808
00:32:30,760 --> 00:32:32,240
You're that agent from Haishen Insurance.

809
00:32:32,240 --> 00:32:34,570
Shengkang Insurance. It doesn't matter.

810
00:32:34,680 --> 00:32:36,010
What do you mean, buddy?

811
00:32:36,360 --> 00:32:37,960
You came here to spy on us?

812
00:32:38,320 --> 00:32:39,120
I'm here to see Lawyer Xiao.

813
00:32:39,120 --> 00:32:40,880
You're here to make trouble.

814
00:32:41,200 --> 00:32:41,880
Luo Zhi,

815
00:32:42,760 --> 00:32:43,560
get out.

816
00:32:46,360 --> 00:32:47,880
You come back. He gets out.

817
00:32:48,360 --> 00:32:49,880
He even tested me on the law.

818
00:32:49,880 --> 00:32:50,740
Get out of here.

819
00:32:51,440 --> 00:32:52,360
You're just looking for trouble.

820
00:32:52,360 --> 00:32:53,040
Slow down, no rush.

821
00:32:53,040 --> 00:32:54,360
You're quite helpful, aren't you?

822
00:32:54,360 --> 00:32:56,200
We just work together like this. So what?

823
00:32:56,200 --> 00:32:56,680
You still have the mood

824
00:32:56,680 --> 00:32:57,360
to shoot a vlog?

825
00:32:57,360 --> 00:32:58,080
Right?

826
00:32:58,160 --> 00:32:59,280
Get out. Get out.

827
00:32:59,440 --> 00:32:59,900
Get out.

828
00:33:00,120 --> 00:33:00,320
Go.

829
00:33:00,320 --> 00:33:01,080
Lawyer Li.

830
00:33:03,040 --> 00:33:03,760
Dong Beihu.

831
00:33:03,920 --> 00:33:05,240
Just caught a spy. I caught him.

832
00:33:05,240 --> 00:33:06,320
What spy?

833
00:33:06,840 --> 00:33:08,600
Well, are you okay?

834
00:33:08,640 --> 00:33:09,400
I'm fine.

835
00:33:09,600 --> 00:33:11,400
Let's go to the cafe to talk.

836
00:33:11,400 --> 00:33:11,930
Let's go.

837
00:33:14,160 --> 00:33:14,960
Interesting.

838
00:33:16,400 --> 00:33:17,560
Really interesting.

839
00:33:17,560 --> 00:33:18,640
What are you two doing?

840
00:33:18,640 --> 00:33:19,200
What do you mean, what are we doing?

841
00:33:19,200 --> 00:33:20,400
He came over and asked a bunch of questions.

842
00:33:20,400 --> 00:33:21,600
He came to provoke us.

843
00:33:21,600 --> 00:33:22,920
Right, testing me on the law.

844
